      "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">I think this is a reasonable approach, but this implementation of <code class=\"notranslate\">default_preserves_rel_children_none</code> actually asserts that <em>every</em> node satisfies <code class=\"notranslate\">rel_children(None)</code>. So it is trivially solving the admits, because it is much too strong. Instead try it with <code class=\"notranslate\">ensures Self::default(lv).rel_children(None)</code> and see if that works?</p>",
      "body_text": "I think this is a reasonable approach, but this implementation of default_preserves_rel_children_none actually asserts that every node satisfies rel_children(None). So it is trivially solving the admits, because it is much too strong. Instead try it with ensures Self::default(lv).rel_children(None) and see if that works?",
