      "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Basically, in <code class=\"notranslate\">insert_preserves_inv</code>, we need the <code class=\"notranslate\">rel_children</code> between the inserted node and the last node given by <code class=\"notranslate\">recursive_visit</code>; in <code class=\"notranslate\">remove_preserves_inv</code>, we need the relationship between None and the last node given by the path.</p>",
      "body_text": "Basically, in insert_preserves_inv, we need the rel_children between the inserted node and the last node given by recursive_visit; in remove_preserves_inv, we need the relationship between None and the last node given by the path.",
      "body": "Basically, in `insert_preserves_inv`, we need the `rel_children` between the inserted node and the last node given by `recursive_visit`; in `remove_preserves_inv`, we need the relationship between None and the last node given by the path.",
